# ---------------- Zombie.events (Task 16 Part A: random-angle wander) ----------------
# A shambling zombie: it picks a random direction, walks it for 20-60 ticks, picks another —
# no waypoint grid, so the movement never looks like a patrol route. Seeing the player takes
# it out of the wander and into a chase; losing sight sends it back to shambling.

when me appears
  enemy type "Zombie"
  set my mode to "patrol"
  wander speed 60

# A zombie that bumps into the player while wandering still bites.
when me is near Player by 40
  me is wandering
  face Player

when me sees Player by my SightDistance
  set my mode to "chase"
  face Player
  goto Player speed 100 facing forward

when every 0.2 seconds
  my mode is "chase"
  goto Player speed 100 facing forward

when me stops seeing Player
  set my mode to "patrol"
  wander speed 60
